	(text "OPTION A BOARD SPLIT: POOL1/POOL2 and FC1/FC2 are separate boards, so each has its own tri-state merge buffers here.\nPOOL2 group (U60..U65) mirrors the POOL1 group (U52..U57); FC2 pair (U58/U59) mirrors the FC1 pair (U48/U49).\nEnables are per engine, so only the active board drives ADDR/DATA.  S01 serialises the stages; no two groups are enabled together."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 790 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "012876cf-82cf-4e83-8d11-8c6512622e22")
	)

